{
  "title": "Taweez against Satan's Evil Insinuations",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "Those who suffer from Satan's evil insinuations are advised to pray for Almighty Allah's protection and say the following:\nاٰمَنْتُ بِاللهِ وَ بِرَسُوْلِهٖ مُخْلِصًا لَهُ الدِّيْنَ۔\nAAMANTU BILLAAHI WA BI-RASOOLIHI MUKHLISAL LAHUD DEEN.\nI believe in Allah and His Messenger, sincere to Him in religion.\nShaykh al-Shahid has quoted the Holy Prophet (s) as saying: There are two kinds of devils. The jinn devils can be dispelled by this saying:\nلَا حَوْلَ وَ لَا قُوَّةَ اِلَّا بِاللهِ الْعَلِيِّ الْعَظِيْمِ۔\nLAA HAWLA WA LAA QUWWATA ILLAA BILLAAHIL A'LIYYIL A'ZEEM.\nThere is no power and no strength except with Allah, the Most High, the All-magnificent.\nThe human devils can be dispelled by invoking Almighty Allah's blessings upon the Holy Prophet and his Household."
}
